WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.650
It may be a faint dream, but let me see it
Hakanaki yume saredo yume misete

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.190
I'm in a complete daze under the sun
Konmei ryouran ni under the sun wow wow

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.920
Guided only by my flowering love for you
Konmei ryouran ni do ai do wow wow

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.530
Let the flower of life bloom
Hirakeyo inochi no hana

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.390
Let it follow its red hot desires
Akaku atsuku midasarete

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.550
This flame runs through the pulses
Fujouri na mirai no kodou

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.350
Of the absurd future
Kakenukeru honoo

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.450
I feel so guilty for devoting myself to earning your love
Aisaretakute kono mi sasageru tsumibukasa ga

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.530
I feel it tingling inside me
Watashi no naka de jirijiri shiteru ne

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.030
Desire
Yokubou

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.740
A bolt of lightning that brings about tomorrow
Sore wa ashita wo maneku inazuma

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:50.660
And turns into great pleasure
Yagate tsuyoi yorokobi ni naru

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:56.510
I'm sure you don't know yet
Mada shiranai hazu anata wa kitto

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:03.250
It's cruel when you can't even have a faint dream
Hakanaki yume saredo yume minu hibi wa mugoi yo

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:08.220
I want to hold on to these newborn desires
Umaretate no negai wo tada dakishimete itai

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:11.510
More wild than soft
Yasashii yori mo hageshiku ne

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:14.710
That will make my day
Sore de ima ga michite kuru sa

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:21.230
Who is going to protect this world (this dangerous world)
Michibikarete tashikameru sekai wa (ayaui sekai wa)

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:23.150
That I can only see for myself?
Dare ga mamoru

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:29.670
I can do it, so love me truly
Mamoreru dakara honki de ai shiteyo

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.490
<b>Early Morning</b>

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.000
<b>True Shadow</b>

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Closed

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.580
Battle for the title of Number One Maid?

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:39.380
What's this, Gutsugutsu-san?

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:45.920
If we want to pay back our debts, we need to increase the maid cafe's profits.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.890
And you think that making us compete against each other will achieve that.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:55.470
The maid with the most sales will earn the title of Number One Maid.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:02:01.190
Well, it's obvious from the get-go who the winner will be.

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:07.670
And the maid with the lowest amount of sales will be forced to leave the dojo!

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:14.710
Even if it <i>can</i> become a Master Samurai, a monkey's still a monkey.

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:17.380
Being a good maid is just asking too much.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:19.960
This competition will undoubtedly end with my overwhelming victory,

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:24.410
and since the monkey's definitely gonna end up last, I can finally get rid of it!

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:29.070
Your plan's written all over your face.

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:30.800
You're disgusting.

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:39.280
What happened?

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:41.860
Mataemon-han is a bit...

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:44.020
You call this nothing?

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:45.820
This again.

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:50.070
Hey, Musashi.

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:51.320
Fight me again.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.180
It's a waste of time.

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:54.200
Indeed.

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:56.940
The last time you two crossed swords,

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.160
you fought for seven straight days and nights,

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.870
and it still ended in a draw.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.590
Who are you kidding? Accept my challenge.

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:06.160
Just a little more.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.700
Yeah, I know.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.520
I'm fine now.

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.280
Please leave me alone.

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:19.000
All right.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:19.600
Oh my.

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:22.440
<b>Current 1st</b>

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:24.560
<b>Current 2nd</b>

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:26.440
<b>Current 3rd</b>

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.780
What's the meaning of this?!

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.420
How can the monkey have the most sales?

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:36.120
How can I possibly be in last place?!

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:41.250
They have to be fudging the numbers to make me lose!

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:42.750
Number

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:47.670
So cute!

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:50.670
Come over here too, Sasuke-chan!

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:53.560
Still as popular as ever.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:56.020
And even when it turns back into a monkey...

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:58.330
Look! She turned into a monkey!

00:03:58.330 --> 00:03:59.640
It gets even more popular.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.420
This is indeed a grave situation.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.060
What are the others doing?

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.570
Number

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:10.310
Welcome back, milady Mucchan!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.610
Hey! I'm back, Fake.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:15.490
But I <i>am</i> the real one.

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:18.870
Oh right, she's got a regular.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:22.120
But the Tokugawa duo shouldn't have any customers.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:23.620
Number

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:29.160
All of you will order at least two courses!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.640
Do you understand?

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:31.380
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:34.470
Th-That's an abuse of her authority!

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:36.220
Hanzou!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:40.180
Don't hog all the points for yourself!

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.600
R-Right.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:46.560
You'll have to eat ten people's worth of food today as well!

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.310
You got a problem with that?

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:49.480
N-Not at all!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.690
It must be tough to have someone always bossing you around.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.000
But even if that's how the Tokugawa duo is doing things,

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.320
Matabei should still be in last place.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:58.820
Number

00:04:58.820 --> 00:04:58.830
Beta-san!
Number

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.960
Beta-san!

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.450
Hello, Juubei-san.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.340
I'll be your customer again today!

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:10.710
Oh, thank you very much.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.440
How can I be losing to <i>them</i>?!

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.380
That's probably because...

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:17.970
you're always slacking off like this.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:22.140
I think it's pretty much decided who the worst maid will be.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:26.310
Isn't it about time you started packing your things?

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:29.270
Th-This is bad.

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:33.280
If things stay like this, instead of chasing the monkey out, <i>I'll</i> be forced to leave!

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:36.610
Wh-What am I supposed to do?

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:41.160
That's right! The secret behind the monkey's popularity!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:46.250
It must be its power as a Master Samurai!

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:49.750
After business hours

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.260
Execution!

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:58.820
It's perfect!

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:00.760
How did I do so well on my first attempt with makeup?

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.420
I'm elegant and gorgeous!

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:08.370
Not to mention the all-natural ingredients that emphasize my greatness!

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:12.320
Now I can take everything that beast Muneakira's got.

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:17.660
Looks like the beast Muneakira still isn't here.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:20.820
Oh? What's that light coming from the kitchen?

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:23.050
We'll talk about the details later.

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.370
Take a look at this, Muneakira.

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:27.400
Wh-What's this?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:30.330
The maid cafe's customer base is steadily growing,

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:34.170
but our losses show no signs of slowing down.

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:36.270
Do you know why?

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:42.360
Well, looking at the figures, Kanetsugu
seems to be responsible for all the losses.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:46.810
Yes. Every time she screws up in the shop, our losses get that much bigger.

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:50.070
Honestly, she's just not cut out to be a maid.

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:52.940
We can't allow her to stay here any longer.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.230
I can't agree with that!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.150
Kanetsugu is one of us!

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:05.700
She came up with this sales competition because she wanted to help the dojo!

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:09.710
We can't just let go of such an admirable comrade.

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:13.880
Right now, her efforts do more harm than good,

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.840
but I'm certain she'll improve with time.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.760
You really are too kind.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:24.440
It's almost time for the limited sales period to start.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.360
You should get going.

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:28.060
So is that it?

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:31.520
Yeah. Leave the rest to us.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:33.310
Okay.

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:36.010
I'm counting on you guys to finish the rest.

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:42.390
And try to be nice to Kanetsugu, okay?

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.640
Muneakira...

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:50.790
So what should we do about Kanetsugu?

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:55.380
I'm sure she's gonna demand to become a Master Samurai to try and oppose Sasuke.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:08:00.630
Still, no matter how hard she tries, she'll never be a Master Samurai.

00:08:02.070 --> 00:08:03.230
I know, right?

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:07.600
How could she possibly have such a strong bond and level of trust with Muneakira?

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:08.850
Indeed.

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:12.730
Bond and trust...

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:15.270
Huh? I just heard a voice coming from the dojo.

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.870
Hey! Is someone there?

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.540
N-No!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:25.700
There's definitely no one here!

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.370
You're obviously right here.

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:32.040
Why did you do that?

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:35.130
What happened to your face?

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:37.500
What were you planning on doing with Muneakira?

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.220
Th-That's not it!

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.560
Who'd ever consider doing things with that brute?

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.890
I'm surprised you can say that while you're dressed in those clothes.

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:50.870
No matter what you try,
you're still gonna finish last.

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:54.980
At least try not to increase our losses by doing something stupid.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:09:00.440
Just remember that if it comes down to closing the dojo, you'll be the cause!

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:06.860
So it's my fault that the dojo...

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:10.410
What's wrong with you?
Suddenly, you're quiet.

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:16.330
Were we too harsh on her?

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:20.250
We only told her the truth.
Don't worry about it.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.420
R-Right.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:30.090
We caught some nice deals again today.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:30.830
Yeah!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:35.370
It's all thanks to you two. Really, thank you.

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:40.380
I'll go with you to help out every day, okay?

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.210
Okay, I'll be counting on you.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:44.400
We're back!

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:47.700
We're back! We got lots of stuff too!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:03.420
If we change things a bit right here...

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:03.960
Got it!

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.010
This way we can balance out Kanetsugu's blunders!

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.400
Yuki, have you seen Sacchin?

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.180
It's run off again.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.640
Wasn't it hanging around with you guys?

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:17.980
It disappeared after we got back home.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.600
Could it be thinking of leaving again?

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:26.200
Don't worry. It knows it's being useful.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:29.200
I doubt it'd consider leaving again.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.530
That's good to hear.

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:33.610
I bet it's in the bath with Matabe-

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.090
Yukimura!

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:36.000
Bad news!

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.900
Kanetsugu's gone!

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:39.870
She's not in the doghouse?

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.880
The doghouse has been taken down. It's gone!

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:44.580
What?!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.640
She seemed really hurt.

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.550
What happened, Yukimura?

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:51.320
I think...

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.050
she might've left for good.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.640
What?

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:57.100
No way!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.030
Don't follow me!

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.690
Then go back!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.430
You're the Number One Maid!

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.230
Did you find anything?

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:35.950
She wasn't there!

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:37.680
She wasn't at the station's central exit either.

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:40.730
That means she's not at the station.

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:42.650
She might've left without waiting for the train.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:46.270
Since we can't find her,
that's the most likely scenario.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:50.320
If Sasuke is with her, it's probably leaving clues for us.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:55.240
Yeah. We should split up and
search for clues before it's too late.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.590
Got it!
Okay!

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:07.500
That's strange. I should've
arrived at the station by now.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.860
Just shut up already!

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:32.820
What do you want?

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.540
What are you doing?!

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:09.880
Monkey...

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.530
Kanetsugu!

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:18.490
Juubei!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.130
Are you all right, Juubei?

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:23.100
Yeah.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:25.330
A banana peel?

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:28.230
What's wrong, Onii-chan?

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:34.190
That peel might be one of the clues that
Yukimura said Sasuke would leave behind.

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:35.430
We should hurry, Juubei.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:55.480
That's right. Sasuke has a time limit.

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:01.740
In our current state, we're no match for this Dark Samurai.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:04.230
But I should at least try to save Sasuke!

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.970
Get out of here, monkey!

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:29.100
Hurry! Run!

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:30.770
Now!

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:39.990
I'm not letting you go anywhere!

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:43.400
Onii-chan! Here's another!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.410
This way!

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:49.750
Huh? There's no banana peel here.

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.740
Now we don't know which way to go.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:57.320
Sacchin?

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:18.780
Just... kill me already.

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:20.200
Gutsugutsu-san!
Just... kill me already.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:20.570
Gutsugutsu-san!

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.260
Kanetsugu!

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.080
A Dark Samurai!

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:31.810
Gutsugutsu-san!

00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:32.750
Dammit!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:34.800
Kanetsugu!

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:42.030
I'm going to die here.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.830
Is that... an angel?

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:51.230
No, it's not. Why is Muneakira here?

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.030
Onii-chan!

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:57.500
An enemy?

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:00.320
Uh-oh! She's coming this way!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.360
What should we do?

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:05.780
Juubei!

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.070
Onii-chan!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.870
Kanetsugu's in bad shape!

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.310
She's lost consciousness!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:13.470
Kanetsugu! Wake up, Kanetsugu!

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:16.610
Kanetsugu, please wake up!

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.680
No. She isn't breathing.

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:39.080
You're not coming any closer!

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:42.950
I won't let you get closer! You hear?!

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:46.870
Kanetsugu, please! Just open your eyes!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.160
Kanetsugu!

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:50.010
I can hear Muneakira's voice.

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:52.440
Don't die! Please don't die, Kanetsugu!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:56.210
His voice is desperately crying out to me.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:17:00.880
He's even shedding tears for me.

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.550
Muneakira...

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:34.960
K-Kanetsugu...

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.190
What...

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:38.540
Huh? Huh?!

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:41.010
Gutsugutsu-san! You did it!

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:49.890
Are you okay, Juubei?

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:53.430
Gutsugutsu-san!

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:58.290
So this is the power of a Master Samurai?

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:02.020
It's amazing! I'm overflowing with power!

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:06.280
You roughed me up pretty badly earlier.

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:11.410
But now that I'm a Master Samurai, you won't have your way anymore!

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:15.370
Naoe-Style Warhammer Technique! Quarrel Top!

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:32.770
Amazing. Her power's on par with the Dark Samurai's!

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:34.720
Gutsugutsu-san!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:58.780
What's that?

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.540
Could it be Kanetsugu?

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:06.170
Gutsugutsu-san!

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:09.150
Are you all right, Gutsugutsu-san?

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:15.730
But of course! I crushed that worthless woman flat!

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:16.970
You're so cool!

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:20.140
Don't get too cocky over there!

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:23.840
But that was a pretty nice blow.

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:26.900
I know! Wasn't it, though?

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:30.490
Yeah, it woke me up.

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:34.450
That should do it for tonight.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.410
Stop right there!

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.730
Let her go, Kanetsugu.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:41.150
You can't keep fighting with that weapon.

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:45.790
M-My new hammer!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:58.890
What's so funny, you damn monkey?!

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:01.230
Don't call it "monkey." It's Sacchin.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:04.770
Anyway. I went through all of that to help you escape.

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.830
Why are you still here?

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:08.880
Sasuke didn't run away.

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:12.210
It came to find us.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:14.070
It asked us to save you.

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:17.690
It's not like I asked it to or anything.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.450
I planned on winning all by myself.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.540
Muneakira!

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.210
What are you doing all the way out here?

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:27.300
Did you find Kanetsugu-san?

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.270
Yeah. Sasuke was with her too.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.040
Why do you look like that?

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.800
Don't tell me you became a Master Samurai!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:41.680
No longer will you be able to look down on me.

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.590
That would mean that Muneakira...

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:46.690
You kissed her?!

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:49.670
Well...

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:50.600
Uh...

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:52.440
I didn't have a choice!

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:52.670
So Kanetsugu-san actually...

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:54.840
She was attacked by a Dark Samurai

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:54.890
It would seem she really <i>did</i> trust Muneakira, even if she tried to hide it.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:57.530
and stopped breathing, so I had to gave her CPR!

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:59.170
Is that really true?
It would seem she really <i>did</i> trust Muneakira, even if she tried to hide it.

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:00.370
You're not lying, are you, Muneakira?!

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:01.550
Hey, let's go home already!

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:02.810
I'm not lying!

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:03.410
I'm really hungry now.
I'm not lying!

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.580
I'm really hungry now.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.250
Let's do that.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.370
Let's go home, Gutsugutsu-san!

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:15.840
But I...

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:19.110
What are you waiting for, Kanetsugu?

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:20.390
Let's go home together.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:23.230
Yeah, to our home.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:29.360
I guess I don't have a choice.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:32.210
Then let's all head back home.

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:36.700
Episode Three

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:12.920
I've been wondering about this for a while.

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:17.360
What's the "bride" in Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride supposed to mean?

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:19.980
How can you be so ignorant, Muneakira?

00:23:19.980 --> 00:23:22.030
It's a synonym for "shiny."

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:25.270
I'm sure some glorious, shining samurai will be showing up very soon!

00:23:25.270 --> 00:23:28.090
Princess Sen, I think you're confusing it with "bright."

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:31.010
Stop the cameras! Erase all of the recordings!

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:34.430
Everyone forget what I just said! We're shooting this again.

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:36.670
Next time: Bride of the General.

00:23:36.670 --> 00:23:39.940
I won't let you put this in the blooper reel!
